  "question": {
    "text": "Two identical metal plates are given positive charges <math><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> respectively. If they are now brought close together to form a parallel plates capacitor with capacitance <math><mi>C</mi></math>, the potential difference between them is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "O8W0d",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
